width: 100%;\" /></section><p style=\"text-align: center; margin-right: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-left: 16px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span><span style=\"line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">扫描上方二维码</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin-right: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-left: 16px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span><span style=\"line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">或点击</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">「</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">阅读原文</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">」</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold;\">关注专区。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><span></span></section><section><span></span></section>",
